FACTOR(N):
  if N = 1: return []
  if N is prime (AKS): return [N]
  if N = m^e for some e ≥ 2 (integer roots, e ≤ log2 N): return FACTOR(m) repeated e times
  trial-divide N by all primes ≤ B(N); recurse on each prime found; let N' be the cofactor
