SQ_SEARCH(A, ℓ):           # deterministic function of (A, ℓ); [pcest] §1, Lemma 1.3; [lv6] Prop BS
  gcd check ℓ
  Gauss-reduce a basis of Λ_ℓ(g); if λ1 < √ℓ/(2S): return FAIL      # irregular: no candidates (Lemma 1.3)
